{"_v":1,"id":"fela-2012","bd":{"positive":4,"mixed":1,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Marilyn Stasio","o":"Variety","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2012/film/reviews/the-end-of-time-1117948020/","d":"2012-07-23","q":"Bill T. Jones has created a theatrical experience that's as much a spiritual celebration as it is a musical biography, honoring the rebellious spirit of the Nigerian musician and political activist."},{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.newsday.com/entertainment/theater/fela-misses-a-few-storytelling-beats-1.1618457","q":"I know I should feel hard-wired to enjoy - no, to love - \"Fela!\""},{"cn":"David Sheward","o":"Backstage","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.backstage.com/bso/reviews-ny-theatre-broadway/ny-review-fela-1004046556.story","d":"2012-07-12","q":"The highlight of the evening is an exhilarating challenge sequence, with each member of the chorus delivering a stunning solo."},{"cn":"Thom Geier","o":"Entertainment Weekly","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.ew.com/ew/article/0,,20322276,00.html","q":"Part biography, part music lesson, part dance party, Fela! is a unique theatrical experience, and Fela himself is its beating heart and soul."},{"cn":"Matt Windman","o":"amNewYork","s":79,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"http://www.amny.com/urbanite-1.812039/theater-review-fela-3-5-stars-1.3834800","d":"2012-07-12","q":"Bill T. Jones’ audacious musical 'Fela!,' a truly explosive tribute to Nigerian icon Fela Anikulapo Kuti, opened Off-Broadway and immediately caught on with theatergoers."},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":43,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"http://www.talkinbroadway.com/world/Fela!2012.html","d":"2012-07-12","q":"It may be unfair to judge the whole of a years-long revolution by the behavior of its earliest proponents, but sometimes evolution’s roiling waves make it impossible ignore a long-standing battle’s context."}],"au":{"score":64,"designation":"Dis